{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人穎喬與張馳豪（Aska）今日（4日）出席《2026年度叱咤樂壇流行榜頒獎典禮》記者會，穎喬以一身亮眼的「毛毛裝」造型現身，被問及會否覺得炎熱時，她笑言：「熱啊，冇計啦，最緊要靚。</p><p>（除唔除得？</p><p>）會冇咁好睇，同埋造型會冇咁完整。</p><p>」她續指造型</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T11:05:28.739695+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T10:26:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T10:58:24.780592+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T10:58:24.780592+00:00","content_hash":"bf8992fd467534f89538b591eac35d81971b214c9dbf94ad1878783b49aff6ad","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}